            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Window: =={O(n)}== time, each char enters and leaves once",
                "Fixed size: add right, drop left",
                "Variable: expand, then shrink while invalid",
                "Lowercase letters: count array of ==26==",
                "Palindrome: ==2n-1== centres, expand while `s[l]==s[r]`",
                "==O(n^2)== time, O(1) space; length = `r-l-1`"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. KMP and Rabin-Karp",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`lps[i]` = longest proper prefix that is also a suffix",
                "Mismatch: `j=lps[j-1]`, text pointer never moves back",
                "KMP is ==O(n+m)==; period = `m-lps[m-1]`",
                "Roll: `h=((h-s[i]*B^(m-1))*B+s[i+m]) mod M`",
                "**Verify** the substrings on a hash match",
                "Rabin-Karp: expected O(n+m), worst case O(n*m)"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "blue"
