              "type": "qa",
              "q": "Longest substring without repeats on `abba`. The code sets `l = last[c] + 1` with no max. What does it return?",
              "a_bullets": [
                "It returns 3; the answer is 2 (`ab` or `ba`).",
                "At the last `a`, last[a]=0 so l moves back to 1, and the window `bba` holds a repeat.",
                "Use `l = max(l, last[c]+1)`."
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "qa",
              "q": "For P = `aabaa`, what is the lps array, and what is the shortest repeating period?",
              "a_bullets": [
                "lps = [0,1,0,1,2].",
                "Period = m - lps[m-1] = 5 - 2 = 3, so the pattern is built from `aab`."
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "qa",
              "q": "You insert only `apple` into a trie. What do search(`app`) and startsWith(`app`) return?",
              "a_bullets": [
                "search is false and startsWith is true.",
